{"3969640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PENANCE", "steam_appid": 3969640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.avif?t=1787743931\" alt=\"Horizontal image of Peace never lasts past sunset in English\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras_big/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.webp?t=1787743931 width=1560 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling. Wars, global warming, AI dystopia, and corporate greed have brought the world to the brink. You awaken as Calen in a place created from an experiment that was meant to save humanity. But something went wrong, and what once seemed like humanity’s solution became a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sienna, your wife, is missing. All she left behind is a note. Now, you must find her. But when night falls, creatures begin to move through the fog. You must survive if you hope to return to the life you once dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a secret can change everything, and the deeper you go, the more the truth begins to reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.poster.avif?t=1787743931\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.webm?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.mp4?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth:</strong> Infiltrate hostile areas, evade patrols, and move silently to avoid the creatures that emerge at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong> Search for scarce supplies and ammunition when escape is no longer an option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve challenges to move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight:</strong> Battle both human enemies and horrifying creatures of many kinds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and night mechanic:</strong> Explore levels across day and night, facing different environments and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person and Third-Person Gameplay:</strong> Play in either first-person or third-person view. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.poster.avif?t=1787743931\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.webm?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.mp4?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight offers time to explore and face human enemies. But when night falls, the air thickens, the hunt begins, and everyone becomes a target. Creatures emerge from the shadows, turning survival into a fight against the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.poster.avif?t=1787743931\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.webm?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.mp4?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.avif?t=1787743931\" alt=\"Horizontal image of Peace never lasts past sunset in English\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras_big/4c52f97195f660de27d4572f0af5fb80.webp?t=1787743931 width=1560 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling. Wars, global warming, AI dystopia, and corporate greed have brought the world to the brink. You awaken as Calen in a place created from an experiment that was meant to save humanity. But something went wrong, and what once seemed like humanity’s solution became a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sienna, your wife, is missing. All she left behind is a note. Now, you must find her. But when night falls, creatures begin to move through the fog. You must survive if you hope to return to the life you once dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a secret can change everything, and the deeper you go, the more the truth begins to reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.poster.avif?t=1787743931\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.webm?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/6c8b7f4c36875dfb29fce4351c8f04d2.mp4?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth:</strong> Infiltrate hostile areas, evade patrols, and move silently to avoid the creatures that emerge at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong> Search for scarce supplies and ammunition when escape is no longer an option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve challenges to move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight:</strong> Battle both human enemies and horrifying creatures of many kinds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and night mechanic:</strong> Explore levels across day and night, facing different environments and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person and Third-Person Gameplay:</strong> Play in either first-person or third-person view. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.poster.avif?t=1787743931\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.webm?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/bcb73da02d00a9809cb531e76ab0b5bc.mp4?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight offers time to explore and face human enemies. But when night falls, the air thickens, the hunt begins, and everyone becomes a target. Creatures emerge from the shadows, turning survival into a fight against the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.poster.avif?t=1787743931\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.webm?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/extras/00c4dbff41f7e093416c2cc5769afcd4.mp4?t=1787743931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "PENANCE is a single-player experience where you play as Calen, a former ranger trapped in a place that feels familiar, yet wrong. Day and night levels bring different dangers, forcing you to fight with whatever you can find to survive and uncover the truth behind it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/5a934234d7411416620526cafaf8da1ec4fb435d/header.jpg?t=1787743931", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/a3da3624471bb8718037916019bf476cce5090f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787743931", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969640/a3da3624471bb8718037916019bf476cce5090f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787743931", "website": "https://www.kitsundi